# landmark (assets/world3d/priory/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Puddingstone Priory: the chapel with its bell tower and spire across the back,
# and a cloister arcade under a lean-to slate roof along the east.
box      stone   at 98 0 -2 size 108 30 32 id priory-nave
